<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ZEP" style="id">Zefaniah</book>
  <para style="h">Zefaniah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zefaniah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zefaniah</para>
  <para style="mt">Zefaniah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah siangpahrang Amon fapa Josiah chan ah Zefaniah sinah Pathian bia a phanmi cu hihi a si. Zefaniah cu Kushi fapa a si, Kushi cu Gedaliah fapa a si, Gedaliah cu Amariah fapa a si, Amariah cu Hezekiah fapa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vawlei cung i a ummi thil vialte cu thiang tein ka phiah hna lai, tiah Bawipa nih a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Minung he saram he ka phiah hna lai, Van i a zuangmi va hna le rili chung i a ummi nga hna cu ka phiah hna lai. Miṭhalo cu ka hrawh hna lai i minung cu vawlei cungin ka hloh lai, ti hi Bawipa bia hrimhrim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah ram cungah le Jerusalem khua chung i a ummi vialte hna cungah khan ka kut ka samh lai; Baal biaknak thil a tang rihmi kha a hmanung bik tiangin ka hrawh lai, An siasal tlangbawi hna min zong kha, hi hmun hin ka hloh hna lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Annih nih vancung thil biak awkah khan inncung ah an kun tawn i Milkom khuazing min in chiat an ser tawn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa kha hnulei an chit i Bawipa kha an kawl lo i ruahnak an hal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa ni cu a nai caah Bawipa hmaiah dai tein um u! Bawipa nih raithawinak kha a timh cang i a sawmmi hna cu a thianter cang hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa raithawinak ni ah cun, Siangpahrang innchungkhar hna le cu innchungkhar chung i bawi upa bikbik hna le ramdangmi thuam a canwgmi vialte hna cu dan ka tat hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khi ni ah cun an bawipa biakinn tual i a lammi vialte kha dan ka tat hna lai i An bawipa inn zaang-ennak ṭhat lonak le hlennak in a khahtertu vialte hna cu dan ka tat fawn hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khi ni ah Nga Kutka timi in au thawng kha a rung thang lai i Sang Hnihnak in ṭah thawng kha a thang lai; Thawng fakpi kha tlang cungin a rung thang lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun khua taw i a ummi hna cu an ṭap an kiao lai, Zeicahtiah chawlet chawhrawl vialte cu an dih cang i Ngun in chaw aa caw aa zuarhmi vialte hna kha an lo cang, tiah Bawipa nih a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khi caan ah Jerusalem cu meiinn he ka kawl lai i An zu ne a rak ri i a rak i ṭhutpi ko i, “ Bawipa nih cun a ṭha zong a chia zong zeihmanh a tuah lai lo,” tiah a timi hna kha dan ka tat hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An chawva vialte kha ramhpiak an si lai i an inn cu hrawhpiak an si lai; Inn cu an sak hna lai, sihmanhsehlaw an umnak hna lai lo, Mitsur dum cu an ser hna lai, sihmanhsehlaw mitsur hang cu an ding lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa ni a liannganmi cu a nai cang, khulrang in a ra lio; Cu ni a thawngpang cu a khaat in a kha, ralkap ralṭha bik hmanh lungdong in an au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cu ni cu thinhunnak ni a si, Cu ni cu vansang-auhnak le hremnak ni a si, Cu ni cu rawhnak le ralnak ni a si, Cu ni cu muihnak le khuachiat ni a si, Cu ni cu khuadawm le minmei zelh ni a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cu ni cu kulhmi khua hna le ralhau sang pipi cung i muko thawng le raltuknak au thawng theih ni a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa nih, “Minung cungah a fakmi harnak kha ka tlunter lai; Bawipa cung i an sual ruangah khan mitcaw bantukin an i chawk lai. An thi cu ti bantukin thlet a si lai i an ruak zong ek bantukin hlonh a si lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Annih khamhnak caah an ngun siseh, an sui siseh, zeihmanh an ṭhahnem lai lo. Bawipa thinhun ni ah cun Bawipa nih khan cu ram cu a ning piin a nahchuahnak mei in a khangh dih lai i cu ram chung i a ummi vialte hna cu khulrang tein an donghnak kha a phakter hna lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I pum tuah u, ningzah hngal lomi miphun, i pum tuah u, Lamhlatpi ah ṭhawl nan si i favai bangin nan loh hlan le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa thinhunnak a kangh in a kangmi cu nan cungah a phak hlanah le Bawipa thinhun ni nan cung i a tlun hlanah i pum tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram chungah toidor tein a phung kha a zul i khua a sami vialte hna, Bawipa cu kawl tuah u; Dinnak cu kawl u, toidornak lungthin cu kawl u; Bawipa thinhun ni ah cun dornak nan hmu kho lai lo dahkaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zeicahtiah Gaza cu chuahtak a si lai, Ashkelon cu ṭiaotak a si lai; Chun ah Ashdod mi cu dawi an si lai i Ekron mi cu hloh an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rili kam ram i khua a sami Kereth miphun hna, ngai tuah u, Bawipa bia cu nanmah ralchanh in chim a si cang; Filistin mi hna, nan ram cu ka tei lai i ka hrawh cikcek lai i a chungah ahohmanh um loin ka tuah lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun nang Kereth cu, tuukhal hna thlam le tuu riahnak hmun ah na cang dih lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rilikam ram cu Judah ram mi a tangmi hna ta a si lai. Bawipa an Pathian nih a merhnawh hna lai i An vanṭhatnak kha a pek ṭhan hna lai caah An tuurun kha rilikam ah khan an tlonter hna lai i zanlei ah Ashkelon khua inn chungah khan an riak lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moab mi nih an nehsawhnak hna le Ammon mi nih an zawmhtaihnak hna kha ka theih cang, Zeitindah ka mi kha an serhsat hna i zeitindah an ramri kha an en hna ti kha ka hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cucaah ka nunnak chalh in hi bia hi ka chim: Moab cu Sodom bantuk a si lai i Ammon cu Gomorrah bantuk a si lai, Belh pon, a thumi ram pon, zungzal ram car a si lai, tiah Bawipa, Israel Pathian nih a ti. Ka mi hna lak i a nungmi nih khan an ramh hna lai i Ka miphun chungin a tangmi hna nih khan an ram cu an co lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ralkapbu Bawipa mi kha an serhsat hna i an zawmhtaih hna caah, mah hihi an i porhlawtnak lehrulhnak cu a si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa nih annih cu a ṭihnunnak vialte he a chuahhnawh hna lai; vawlei cung khuazing vialte cu santlailo ah a ser dih hna lai i miphun dang hna rilikam ram le tikulh vialte nih amah cu an biak lai, mi kip nih anmahle an inn cio in an biak lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nannih Kush mi zong, Bawipa vainam in thah nan si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cucaah a kut cu chaklei ah samh seh law Assiria cu hrawk seh, Nineveh cu ṭhio seh law ram car bantukin carter seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khika ah saṭil run le ramlak saram vialte kha an bawk lai. Chimbu ki ngei le langta nih a tung ngan pipi par ah cun bu an ser lai, Chimbu pawl cu thlalangawng in an awn lai i langta cu innleng ah an dir lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi khua hi, ka him ko, tiah amah le amah aa porhmi khua a si i, “Keimah hlei in a dang ahohmanh an um ti lo,” tiah aa timi a si. Atu tah zeidah a si cang kun? Pakpalawng hmun, ramlak saram tlonnak hmun, a pawng i a kalmi paoh nih an cekcekhnawhmi le an kuttum thinhnawhmi a si ko cang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihrem a hmangmi Jerusalem khuapi, mirimnam khua, a cungah ningzahnak tlung ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ralrinnak peknak aw kha zeihmanh a ngaihmi a um lo, Chimhhrinnak kha zeihmanh a lung ah aa kenmi a um lo; Bawipa kha aa bochan lo i a Pathian kha a fuh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A chung i bawi hna cu chiandeih a huk lengmangmi an si, A biaceihtu bawi hna cu zinglei tiang a ngang kho lomi cenghngia an si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A profet hna cu mihrokhrawl, profet taktak a si lomi an si, A tlangbawi hna nih hmunthiang kha an thurhhnawmh i phung kha an duhnak leiah an merh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw a chung i a ummi Bawipa cu a ding i ṭhat lonak kha zeihmanh a tuah lo; Zing fate in pel lo tein khuadei kate ah a biakhiahnak kha a langhter zungzal. Asinain miding lo hna nih cun ṭhat lonak kha an tuah lengmang ko i ningzah zong zeihmanh an hngal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miphun cu ka hloh cang hna, an khuapi cu ka hrawh hna i an kulhnak vampang hna le innsang hna cu an tlu dih. An khualak lam hna cu ahohmanh an i chawh ti lonak thetse ram ah ka ser cang. An khuapi cu an rawk cang, chuahtak an si cang, mi an um ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka cawnpiaknak vialte kha a hngalh ṭhan lai ti ruahchannak in, “A ṭih cu ka ṭih ko law kan chimhhrinnak cu na lung chungah i ken ko,” ka ti. Sihmanhsehlaw hmasa nak hmanh khan ṭhat lonak tuah kha an duh deuh; tuante khan an tho i ṭhat lonak tuah awkah khan an i chawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih, “Ka hngak tuah, miphun hna sual ka phawt hna ni kha, hngak tuah. Miphun hna le siangpahrang hna kha ka thinhunnak toih awkah ka lung kaa thlek cang. Vawlei hi a dihlak in ka thinhunnak mei nih a kangh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khi tikah mi vialte kha hmur thiang ka pek hna lai i Bawipa min cu an auh lai i lungkhat tein a rian an ṭuan lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ethiopia tiva hna ralchan i aa ṭhekmi hna lakin ka sinah zaangfahnak hal in thla a cammi hna nih khan, ka sinah an laksawng kha an rak ka put lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khi ni ah cun ka mi hna cu, Keimah dohnak caah nan rak tuahmi thil ruangah khan nan ning a zak ti lai lo; zeicahtiah nan mi aa porhlawmi le a ruam a kaimi vialte hna kha nan lakin ka ṭhial dih hna lai i ka tlang thiang cungah hin ruamkai in nan um ti lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuka ah cun nunnem le toidormi kha ka umter hna lai i Bawipa min ah cun himnak an kawl lai i ka sinah bawmhnak hal awkah a ra duhmi an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mi chungin a tangmi hna nih khan ahohmanh nih ṭhat lonak an tuah lai lo, lih zong an chim lai lo, hlennak bia kha an hmur in a chuak ti lai lo. Cun dai tein ramhring lakah khan an tlong lai i ahohmanh nih thinphang in an umter ti hna lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zion fanu, lunglawmhnak in au tuah, Israel, teinak au in au tuah; Jerusalem fanu, i lawm law na lungthin dihlak in i lawm tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa nih nangmah an dohtu hna kha an ṭhawlpiak cang i Na ral kha a dawi cang hna; Bawipa Israel siangpahrang cu nan lakah a um i Rawhralnak kha na ṭih awk zeihmanh a um ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khi ni ah cun mah hihi Jerusalem sin chim ding bia cu a si lai: Na thinphang hlah, Maw Zion, na kut tha kha dorhter hna hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa na Pathian cu, nangmah kha him tein umter awkah na chungah ralkap bantukin a um ko; Na cungah a lung aa lawm lai i a tha a nuam lai; A dawtnak cu an hmuhter ṭhan lai; Hlanlio bantuk khan na cungah lunglawmhnak au thawng he aa lawm lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nganfak in na ṭahnak kha ka lakpiak lai i Harnak na inmi ruangah cun nihsawh serhsatnak kha na ing ti lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khi caan a phak tikah, zohhmanh, Nangmah an hremtu vialte hna kha keimah nih ka tongh hna lai. A beimi kha ka chanh hna lai i a ṭhekmi kha ka pumh hna lai; Ka mi hna cu hmasa i zawmhtaih an rak sinak ram paohpaoh ah khan thangṭhatnak le minthannak ka hmuhter ṭhan hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan pumh hna caan a phak tikah cun inn ah kan tlunpi hna lai. Nan vanṭhatnak kha kan pek ṭhan hna tikah, Vawleicung mi vialte sinah minthannak le thangṭhatnak kha kan hmuhter ṭhan hna lai i cucu nan mit in nan hmuh lai. Hi bia a chimtu hi Bawipa a si.
  </para>
</usx>
